cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If this repository helps you, you may cite it as below. It is an informal,
  work-in-progress synthesis of published research, written with Claude, an AI
  assistant by Anthropic. It is not an official standard, not peer-reviewed,
  and not a new result.
title: "business-organisation (work in progress)"
abstract: >-
  What a company is, as an organisation: the functions it must perform, the roles and structure that perform them, its description as an information-processing system, and how it adapts. The first review is written, a first pass of 64 sources ending on a named baseline, B1.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Tewf"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Tewf/business-organisation"
license:
  - Apache-2.0
  - CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - theory of the firm
  - organization design
  - organization theory
  - business process
  - organizational learning
  - literature review
